# Widescreen [restart]
#   Black (USA), default.xbe
#   Nemesis2000 (https://www.jayxbox.com/Retail-Game-Modification/PatchHub.php)
#   Tested with hakuX-lr dbc8b16778 and RetroArch 1.22.2 (x86-64), headless.
#   The full-width 16:9 view in the game's widescreen mode, which otherwise is a little wider than 4:3 and cropped at the top and bottom.
#   Set the console's video to widescreen (the core's Screen Format: Auto does it).
#
# 60 fps [restart]
#   Black (USA), default.xbe
#   hakuX-lr
#   Tested with hakuX-lr dbc8b16778 and RetroArch 1.22.2 (x86-64), headless.
#   The game presents every vblank and steps 1/60 s a frame instead of 1/30 s. Movies, menus and the first mission ran at 60 fps at the normal speed.
#   Checked in the first minute of the first mission only, at 480p and 720p; not play-tested by hand.
#
# 720p (1280x720) [restart]
#   Black (USA), default.xbe
#   hakuX-lr, with the wider view of Nemesis2000's Widescreen patch
#   Tested with hakuX-lr dbc8b16778 and RetroArch 1.22.2 (x86-64), headless.
#   Widescreen 720p with the full-width 16:9 view: the game asks Direct3D for 1280x720 progressive. Title, movies, pause menu and the first mission checked at 1x and 2x render scales.
#   Set Console RAM to 128 MB, enable the RAM limit patch and the core's 720p option; without any of them the game returns to the dashboard.

